    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Grimes are delighted to present 1 Osprey in Barnageeragh Cove, to the market. This spacious three-bedroom home was built in 2010 and offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The property benefits from a B energy rating, two designated parking spaces, a south-west facing rear garden and vacant possession, giving the new owner an excellent opportunity to make the property their own.\n\nThe accommodation is bright and spacious, with generous room proportions and plenty of scope to personalise and modernise to suit individual tastes. The private south-west facing garden provides an ideal outdoor space for relaxing, entertaining and family life.\n\nSituated in Skerries, one of North County Dublin`s most popular coastal towns, the property is ideally located for families, with an excellent choice of primary and secondary schools, numerous sports clubs and recreational facilities, as well as a wonderful selection of cafs, restaurants and local amenities.\n\nSkerries also offers excellent transport connectivity, with regular train services to Dublin City Centre and convenient road links to the M1 and Dublin Airport. Barnageeragh Beach, Ardgillan Park and the surrounding coastal walks are all close by.\n\nWith its spacious accommodation, B energy rating, two parking spaces, private garden and excellent family-friendly location, 1 Osprey offers a fantastic opportunity to create a home in a stunning location with all that Skerries has to offer.\n\nEntrance Hall\n2.09m x 2.07m With tiled floor and carpet staircase.\n\nLiving Room\n4.26m x 3.62m Spacious livingroom to the front of the property with wooden flooring and double doors to the dining area.\n\nKitchen/Diningroom\n5.98m x 3.62m Dining Area, with tiled floor and door to rear garden.\n2.67m x 2.98m Kitchen, wall and floor mounted kitchen units, tiled floor and door to utility room.\n\nGuest WC\n2.09 x 1.37m With WC, WHB and tiled floor\n\nUtility Room\n2.09m x 0.91m Plumbed for washing machine\n\nMaster Bedroom\n4.43m x 3.79m Carpet flooring and fitted sliding wardrobes.\n\nEn-Suite\n2.35m x 1.34m With WC, WHB and walk in shower.Tiled floor and shower area.\n\nBedroom 2\n3.79m x 3.36m With fitted wardrobes and carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 3\n3.91m x 2.97m With built in wardrobe and carpet flooring.\n\nBathroom\n2.35m x 1.62m Tiled Floor, bath with shower attachment, WC wall hung whb.\n\nLanding with Study\nSpacious bright landing with built in study area, large windows and attic access.\n\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
